%% Structure source for workload-cluster-provisioning.svg (overview). Keep the two in sync.
%% The detailed variant is workload-cluster-provisioning-detailed.mmd.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator (nvkectl or API)
    participant MP as Management plane
    participant NICo as NICo (via CAPNICo)
    participant Node as Workload nodes (nvke-agent)
    participant Cust as Customer (kubectl)

    Op->>MP: create cluster
    MP-->>Op: status Provisioning
    MP->>NICo: request machines
    NICo->>Node: boot node OS image
    Node->>MP: attest with TPM
    MP->>Node: kubeadm init, install CNI
    MP->>MP: status Provisioned
    MP->>Node: join remaining nodes
    Op->>MP: get kubeconfig
    Op--)Cust: hand over kubeconfig
    Cust->>Node: kubectl
